flowchart LR
    Iface["NIC enabled IPv6"]
    LL["assign link-local fe80::/64<br/>auto from MAC (or stable_secret)"]
    RA["listen for Router Advertisement<br/>(ICMPv6 type 134)"]
    SLAAC{"SLAAC<br/>(M=0,A=1)?"}
    Auto["assign global from RA prefix<br/>+ EUI-64 or random"]
    DHCP["DHCPv6<br/>(M=1)"]

    NDP["NDP for neighbours<br/>(replaces ARP for IPv6)"]
    DAD["Duplicate Address Detection<br/>(send NS for own addr)"]

    Iface --> LL --> DAD --> RA --> SLAAC
    SLAAC -->|yes| Auto
    SLAAC -->|no| DHCP
    Auto --> NDP
    DHCP --> NDP

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    classDef hot fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    class Auto,DHCP ok
    class SLAAC hot
